      <p source="#source-487-525"><seg source="#source-487-525">君にささぐる心のきほひ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-525-563"><seg source="#source-525-563">火と燃え肉は爛れおちぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-563-631"><seg source="#source-563-572">そは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-572-596"><rb>赫灼</rb><rt>かくやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-596-599">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-599-617"><rb>嘯</rb><rt>うそぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617-631">き吼ゆる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-631-661"><seg source="#source-631-661">落日の海にも似たり。</seg></p>
    </body>
